0,Coastal Konjo language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coastal_Konjo_language,"Coastal Konjo is an Austronesian language of Sulawesi, Indonesia, which belongs to the Makassaric branch of the South Sulawesi subgroup. It is spoken along the coast in the southeastern corner of South Sulawesi in the regencies of Sinjai, Bulukumba and Bantaeng.","Konjo, Coastal",Austronesian
